<title>GERMANY: German April trade surplus rises to 10.4 bln DM.</title>
<headline>German April trade surplus rises to 10.4 bln DM.</headline>
<dateline>WIESBADEN, Germany 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal</p>
<p>Statistics Office reported the following economic indicator (bln</p>
<p>marks):</p>
<p> GERMAN TRADE/CURRENT ACC Apr 97   Mar 97	  Apr 96</p>
<p> Trade balance		+10.4     +9.8	    +7.7</p>
<p> Current account	    + 2.8     +2.9	    -1.3</p>
</text>
